## Part 4: Putting It All Together - Building Projects

### Project Structure

```
my-project/
│
├── index.html
├── styles.css
├── script.js
└── images/
    └── logo.png
```

### Complete Example: Interactive To-Do List

#### HTML (index.html)

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>To-Do List App</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>My To-Do List</h1>

        <form id="todo-form">
            <input 
                type="text" 
                id="todo-input" 
                placeholder="Add a new task..."
                required
            >
            <button type="submit">Add</button>
        </form>

        <ul id="todo-list"></ul>
    </div>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```

#### CSS (styles.css)

```css
* {
    margin: 0;
